      "message": "Can you back up this assertion ? I understand that in a sense you\u0027d want to return this data to a general wildcard query for wifi because you know this traffic happened on wifi, but you don\u0027t know what wifi and it may contain wildly varying wifis. Maybe it\u0027s better to behave like this data was never here in the first place.",
