      "message": "We sure that is TYPE_WIFI and a wildcard query doesn\u0027t care about the key. So, I think as long as the type is TYPE_WIFI, the data should be found by wildcard template.\n\nOr do you think now that if we don\u0027t record a data that contains null wifiNetworkKey then the data that containds null key should not be returned?",
